  "description": "Rounding ties of the contributions (section 8: half up, once per group). Lawyer in ordinario, Cassa Forense, Italian business client (withholding agent), fee €100.30. Spese generali 15 % × 100.30 = 15.045 -> €15.05 (halfUp; halfEven would give 15.04); CPA 4 % × (100.30 + 15.05 = 115.35) = 4.614 -> €4.61; VAT 22 % × (115.35 + 4.61 = 119.96) = 26.3912 -> €26.39; withholding 20 % × 115.35 = €23.07 (CPA excluded). Total 119.96 + 26.39 = €146.35; net payable 146.35 − 23.07 = €123.28. No amount outside VAT: no stamp duty.",
